		{"id":"5742f00c47cf7823","type":"text","text":"# Mybatis","x":-600,"y":4229,"width":166,"height":60},
		{"id":"597166c04967ab05","type":"file","file":"Spring框架/Spring/循环依赖问题/三级缓存解决setter、字段注入.md","x":-2030,"y":300,"width":680,"height":380,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ce1ef2ab893b1ec5","type":"file","file":"Spring框架/Mybatis/项目需要使用mybatis，怎么写？.md","x":-340,"y":4129,"width":727,"height":261,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ea918e33bf762157","type":"text","text":"普通工厂：具体==工厂类==，决定创建**哪一个具体产品对象**。\n抽象工厂：定义统一的==工厂接口==，由不同具体工厂类实现，定义的是创建**一整套相关的产品族对象**。","x":-2480,"y":1171,"width":500,"height":91,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"555677f87488d0f4","type":"text","text":"## 如何实现懒加载？\n在需要使用的前判断一下对象是否为空，如果为空则进行new。\n```java\npublic class UserService {\n\tprivate UserDao userDao;\n\t\n\tpublic UserDao getUserDao() {\n\t\tif (userDao == null) {\n\t\t\tuserDao = new UserDao();\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn userDao;\n\t}\n\n}\n```\n\n如果是多线程的情况，可以用**双重检查锁**：volatile防止重排序 + 可见性，sychronized加锁。\n```java\npublic class UserService {\n\tprivate volatile UserDao userDao;\n\t\n\tpublic UserDao getUserDao() {\n\t\tif (userDao == null) {\n\t\t\tsynchronized (this) {\n\t\t\t\tif (userDao == null) {\n\t\t\t\tuserDao = new UserDao();\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\n\t\treturn userDao;\n\t}\n}\n```\n","x":-2640,"y":-11,"width":560,"height":320,"color":"1"}
	],
